.TH tkuvcard n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkuvcard \- vCard contact viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkuvcard
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows vCard contacts in a tree (FN nodes with property children), via
tclutils::tuvcard. See docs/tkuvcard.md.
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, vcard, contacts
